      "description": "IT Manager for the Division of Surface Water which is charged with carrying out many of the Clean Water Act requirements in the State of Ohio. Acts as a liaison to translate business requirements to ITS and translate ITS jargon back to the business.\n\n- Main data system analyst for an Oracle backed data system that generates over 6 million record points per year with data. The data is exchanged and synchronized between internal system, third-party software, and the federal U.S. EPA system.\n- Gather business requirements to implement software improvements. Provide the requirements to our software providers via Jira and the Agile development process.\n- Provide data reports using SQL Server Reporting Services (SSRS) and R statistical software to transform data into information.\n- Manages 8 staff including technical experts with our eBusiness systems and also administrative professionals who process permits and other administrative processes.",
